[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " Realising that there is nothing for it, you follow the dusty voice's advice and spend some time in\r\n deep contemplation.\r\n \r\n And it seems to be working! Slowly, ever so slowly, the misty greyness begins to coalesce into new\r\n (or is it old?) Shapes and Meanings. Eventually you find that:\r\n "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n You are standing at the east end of a road before a small brick building. Around you is a forest.\r\n A small stream flows out of the building and runs south, down a gully. A wide path leads northwest.\r\n \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " Oh, by the way... \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " Would you like instructions? "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[?2004h Would you like instructions? "]
[4.018, "o", "n"]
[0.091, "o", "o"]
[0.090, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n Fair enough. You can always type INTRO to see it at any time anyway. And if you are new around\r\n here, I also strongly recommend INFO, HELP and VOCABULARY commands.\r\n \r\n Now, as I was saying...\r\n \r\n You are standing at the east end of a road before a small brick building. Around you is a forest.\r\n A small stream flows out of the building and runs south, down a gully. A wide path leads northwest.\r\n \r\n ? \r\u001b[?2004h ? "]
[2.609, "o", "e"]
[0.091, "o", "a"]
[0.092, "o", "s"]
[0.093, "o", "t"]
[0.090, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", " You are inside a small building, a well house for a large spring. Fixed to one wall is a large\r\n poster, titled \"RECENT RENOVATIONS\".\r\n \r\n There are some keys on the floor here.\r\n There is a shiny brass lamp nearby.\r\n \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " ? "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[0.000, "o", " ? "]
[2.613, "o", "r"]
[0.092, "o", "e"]
[0.093, "o", "a"]
