[0.096, "o", "h"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n You are in a 20-foot depression floored with bare dirt. Set into the dirt is a strong steel grate\r\n mounted in concrete. A dry streambed leads into the depression.\r\n \r\n The grate is locked.\r\n \r\n ? \r\u001b[?2004h ? "]
