[0.000, "o", " You are in a small chamber beneath a 3x3 steel grate to the surface. A low crawl over cobbles\r\n leads inward to the west.\r\n \r\n The grate is open.\r\n \r\n And if I may offer a suggestion, you should explore around the building, before venturing into the\r\n cave.\r\n \r\n ? "]
