[0.091, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n You have scored one point out of the possible maximum of 770, using 14 turns.\r\n \r\n You are obviously a rank amateur. Better luck next time.\r\n \r\n To reach the next qualification level you need 49 more points.\r\n\r\n"]
